#: src/mathessible/ui/graph_explorer.py:390
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Left and Right, or J and L, move; Shift moves fluidly; {modifier} with Left or Right goes between"
" landmarks and boundaries. Home and End go to the edges. W A S D move the view. Z zooms in and "
"Shift Z zooms out; hold X or Y while pressing Z for one axis. R restores the view. B plays the "
"graph; Space does too. I changes continuous or discrete sound. P turns sound on or off. C reads "
"the coordinates, V reads the view, N or 1 through 9 selects a function, and {modifier} B toggles "
"a bookmark. {modifier} Z centres the view at the cursor."
msgstr ""
"左右鍵或 J 和 L 移動；Shift 可流暢移動；{modifier} 加左右鍵在地標與邊界間移動。Home 和 End 移至邊緣。W A S D 移動檢視範圍。Z 放大，Shift Z "
"縮小；按 Z 時按住 X 或 Y 只縮放一軸。R 還原檢視範圍。B 播放圖形，空白鍵亦同。I 切換連續與離散聲音。P 開關聲音。C 讀出座標，V 讀出檢視範圍，N 或 1 到 9 "
"選擇函數，{modifier} B 新增或移除書籤。{modifier} Z 將檢視範圍置中於游標。"

